unterstrike_336x280_BTF\"></div></div></div><div></div></div><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-topcontent\"></div></div>\n<p><br />\nAlec \"<b>Slemmy</b>\" White (born August 27, 1990) is a <a href=\"/counterstrike/Retired\" title=\"Retired\">retired</a> <a href=\"/counterstrike/Category:United_States\" title=\"Category:United States\">American</a> professional <i><a href=\"/counterstrike/Counter-Strike:_Global_Offensive\" title=\"Counter-Strike: Global Offensive\">Counter-Strike: Global Offensive</a></i> player. He is mostly known for his period in <a href=\"/counterstrike/Cloud9\" title=\"Cloud9\">Cloud9</a> during which they most notably won <a href=\"/counterstrike/IBUYPOWER/Invitational/2016/Summer\" title=\"IBUYPOWER/Invitational/2016/Summer\">iBUYPOWER Invitational 2016 - Summer</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/counterstrike/index.php?title=Slemmy&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Achievements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"content-ad navigation-not-searchable\"><div id=\"counterstrike_728x90_BTF\"></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"table2 table2--generic\"><div class=\"table2&#95;&#95;container\"><table class=\"table2&#95;&#95;table sortable\"><tbody><tr class=\"table2&#95;&#95;row--head table2&#95;&#95;row--head-title\"><th data-sort-type=\"isoDate\">Date</th><th data-align=\"center\">Place</th><th>Tier</th><th data-align=\"center\">Type</th><th data-align=\"center\"><abbr title=\"Game\">G.</abbr></th><th colspan=\"2\">Tournament</th><th data-align=\"center\">Team</th><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"unsortable\">Result</th><th data-align=\"right\" data-sort-type=\"currency\">Prize</th></tr><tr style=\"display:none\"><td></td></tr><tr class=\"table2&#95;&#95;row--body\"><td data-nowrap=\"\">2018-04-26</td><td data-align=\"center\" data-nowrap=\"\" data-sort